  "rules": [
    "Weapon Price modifies only the base value before wave additions and inflation; Item Prices applies afterwards. Final price, not its factor, is clamped to1.",
    "Affected shop prices include 1 + native endless_factor(wave)/5. The endless recycling basis ignores Item Prices, Weapon Price and endless inflation, but remains capped by the affected shop price.",
    "At shop entry the native destroy_weapons effect removes all owned weapons before upgrade effects and stock generation. Reroll, sync and purchases do not repeat destruction.",
    "Minimum weapons equals max(normal wave guarantee, minimum_weapons_in_shop); locked weapons count against it.",
    "RunData.recycle_weapon increments the personal run-wide challenge once per weapon. Merging and forced removal do not count; existing achievement flags persist."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "The complete stable shop/equipment catalog and remaining generic shop pool/reroll rules are shared open work; this package does not certify all shop parity.",
    "No uploads, Studio, two-client native runtime or mobile acceptance."
  ]
